rm, showed McGuire ahead by only three points, though its age and sponsorship limit its weight.\n\nPerriello, a former congressman, has outraised McGuire and holds a large cash advantage, and he has campaigned with prominent Virginia Democrats. Still, the district's fundamentals and the incumbent's position make McGuire the clear favorite, with Perriello needing a strong national environment or polling surprise to close the gap.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.1914, "margin": -5.2}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.2771, "margin": -4.5}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.2238, "margin": -5.5}]}